OL,3,ANew York City releases documents about
OL,4,Aair quality after 9/11
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew York City has released previously
OL,7,Funseen documents raising concerns about
OL,8,Fair quality in Manhattan in the
OL,9,Faftermath of the 9/11 attacks, Mayor
OL,10,FZohran Mamdani announced on Tuesday.
OL,12,FThe documents from 25 years ago suggest
OL,13,Fthat officials had concerns about toxic
OL,14,Fair after the World Trade Center towers
OL,15,Fcollapsed, while the public was being
OL,16,Freassured the environment at the site,
OL,17,Fknown as Ground Zero, was safe.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
