OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ANew York City releases documents about
OL,4,Aair quality after 9/11
OL,5,
OL,6,F"People got sick because the leaders
OL,7,Fthey trusted lied and told them they
OL,8,Fwere safe to breathe in toxic air,"
OL,9,FMamdani said at a news conference,
OL,10,Fsurrounded by survivors.
OL,12,FThe release resolves a lawsuit brought
OL,13,Fby advocacy group 9/11 Health Watch,
OL,14,Fwhich sued the city for the documents.
